cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use plumbline in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "plumbline: a reproducible evaluation harness for 3D geometric foundation models"
abstract: >-
  plumbline is an evaluation harness for 3D geometric foundation models
  (monocular depth, multi-view depth, pose, and point maps), with
  PDF-verified reproductions of published benchmark numbers.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Blackburn-Matzen"
    given-names: "Kevin"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kmatzen/plumbline"
url: "https://plumbline-bench.org"
# plumbline's own code is Apache-2.0, but the distributed package bundles
# vendored upstream model code under NonCommercial terms (CC BY-NC[-SA], plus
# the VGGT Meta research license), making the aggregate non-commercial only.
# See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the per-component breakdown.
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.2.1"
date-released: "2026-06-16"
keywords:
  - 3d-vision
  - depth-estimation
  - benchmark
  - reproducibility
  - foundation-models
